  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Now back in print, Paulette Jiles's celebrated, multi-award-winning poetry collection. These are poems of scorching intensity, which examine the politics of childhood and love; explore the rigours and blessings of living in the far north; mark the way stations of a life of discovery and exploration. The result is a poetry of singular, telling immediacy"--Publisher.</subfield>
